characters.history:
In the Celestial Realm, he traveled unopposed until he messed with someone he couldn’t mess with and failed to frame Wang Lin. In the end, he lost several clones before being forced to return using the Return Cauldron. He was the first person to from Planet Suzaku to return. When he returned, he landed in the Sea of the Devils and because he had lost too many insects, he began killing again in order to replenish his insects. He destroyed countless sects as he passed them and finally came to the Country of Zhao where he saw the Cloud Sky Sect. During his attack on the Cloud Sky Sect, he was beaten and killed when Wang Lin arrived.&#160;

